            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In an experimental study the work postures at stomatologic works were checked. An objectivation of the reaching space was carried out and dependences of the posture on the kind of equipment and its use were analyzed. It is tried to evaluate the problem of false postures.</AbstractText>
